Creating new branch
git checkout -B feature/lesson -- we will create a new branch and switch to the new branch
git branch -- to verify if we have moved to new branch
touch test2.txt
git add test2.txt
git commit -m "Add test2.txt" -- adds test2.txt to feature/lesson branch printing the message also
git push -u origin feature/lesson -- to push it to the remote location i.e. github
git checkout main -- to get back to main branch
